<description>&lt;p&gt;The Venezuelan army bombed an ELN guerrilla camp in Apure, killing at least 19 rebels, and a drone strike hit an ELN drug depot nearby, causing at least 20 deaths. Oliver Blanco, Venezuela’s foreign minister, met with a U.S. official in Washington, DC to discuss election preparations. President Trump boasted about a one-day operation to capture Maduro and warned of possible U.S. action against Cuba while claiming Venezuelan oil revenues far exceed Iran war costs. Chevron is expanding operations in Venezuela and Exxon is urging caution. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOdmFEc01qd29BWVdWdDlPRkc1ZFJkUHNXcHVDX21oX3pXbWRzcTdpVk5iakhSOEs2QkNSeGU0d1M1ZkQ5R25GWDBPOTFaNElpRGUyOGRjd2xTaWZROEpmeUp0WDlqbE5SWUZFeUFFSkFyeGl2UlRuVHhFZEZfV2xFOER0NVpEcjlBLVpYMzBDdjc5QVY4WVR2ZmtDMUpULWk5aDRZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Military.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQNVJJZW5NTHctM29iaC12Wko1SnJMUkE5SEpEa1ptV2hibUZFQnREWDc0WkpZbXljM1RWTlMtUTVwckE3UGZNdGthWW5sQWFiR2JBUWRtU0tDWmh4b0VrVkZDM3FvRk5hZ2pWdWRBYk9ZU0Nlel9ibGRDbFFzS2pESU44Q2g4VWk4TWVnREtRTEMzcWw0UXNCVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;New Telegraph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNazVJR0tJM3JPUEdWaDdxY2JWZWZKeTF1V04wbW9Ld3hWNVlXT0RXVi1KRXh6OXFLbDhvVWEwU0kxWE9jOWFkdTV4aEVNQTdpbVZveGRGNDB3WWZjZUxnYU1TUVRPWi0wUlZYMVVhODlqM2Z0T21lVW01cGF4SUdsVWxHclF6bUJOMWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Guyana Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNREVjOXhzQVc3YV9DUGp6bk90UFl4bllIWF8wendwdUh4WEpsYk5LOXJyVWFiZVN4U1Rub3MzN0piZDJJcmRCRDV3YVo2bTE3VjZ0bl9rbkZ4SlZkVDNaVFZsQU10NzU2VnhNODdzdHkteTdCMHNuSVFVOGFZM3dxT1piZnZKeDk5UzVyLWxyWE83Q09H?oc=5&quot;&gt;Venezuelanalysis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot